            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Miles Ahead"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have a very similar recipe, but I use 4,not 2, cups of berries for this. I read the reviews of other Allrecipe raters and thank them for the suggestions to add vanilla to the pastry part and cinnamon to the berries. Both enhanced suggestions in addition to decreasing the amount of sugar, enhanced my decades old version of this.",
            "datePublished": "2017-06-12T17:06:55.797Z"
